References: <O8ZsQgNK9YM.BuDqX87-BQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com> <O8ZsQgNK9YM.xVtoxL_TAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/lavaan/c/O8ZsQgNK9YM/m/lmd4J1AZAgAJ>
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="utf-8"
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Thanks a lot for your advice.

The solution you reckoned

Model1    <- '   a =~ z1 + z2 + z3 + z4
                        b  =~ z5 + z6 + z7 + z8
                        c  =~ 0*z1
                        c ~ 1*a + -1*b
                         c ~~ 0*c '

works perfectly well.

I wish you a pleasant day,

Solène

